<title>USA: Knoxville &amp; Knox Cty., Tenn won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Knoxville &amp; Knox Cty., Tenn won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said it won $9.600 million of Knoxville &amp; Knox Cty PBA, Tenn., public facilities refunding lease rental revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.23 percent.</p>
